  "change_note": "Paired to merged Core #351 9f1292b4. Mac CI 39934743106 checked out merge 02965f0; PR head 92608b21 has the identical tree eba0c94a. Final main also includes reviewed R03 #350/#352 probes outside both production component closures; its full-tree CI and Desktop runtime evidence are recorded separately. Rhythm merges now refresh class, subject and slot fingerprint with current source semantics, retain stable task IDs and discard prior approval. Runtime schema, Bridge v1.1, occurrence v1.2, fixtures, Pi/PiDurable 1.0.2 and the 12 public Bridge commands remain unchanged. Same-name recall keeps surviving student B while deleted-name legacy history stays held. Old preparation, artifact and feedback bindings must fail closed before current automatic preparation can resume. Existing scoped recall, grants, captured-prompt receipts, recipient confirmation, feedback lineage and consent-bound local usage remain in place. ICS/DOCX adoption requires current owner read and explicit confirmation; chapter review does not automatically prepare tasks. PDF/image/OCR/.doc adoption, legacy file update/cancel/pairing/timetable and unsupported commands/projections are not enabled. R03 v3 capsules, SQLite probes, typed claims and native PDF/image diagnostics have no production Runtime entry. Collection stays off without an approved receiver and policy; live capabilities require explicit isolated-canary activation. No external sends, automatic material approval or claim of signed/installed validation."
